BT /F1 10 Tf 72 510 Td (Area supervisors are responsible for enforcing this policy. Where a dollar amount is listed in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 496 Td (Section 4, it is the potential fine exposure the company has assessed for that requirement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 482 Td (Where no amount is listed, the current OSHA maximum penalty for the cited standard applies.) Tj ET
