BT /F1 10 Tf 76 388 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 388 Td (Chemical-resistant nitrile gloves at all times when handling reagents. Ref: Sec. 4.1\(a\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 374 Td (29 CFR 1910.138. Severity: Serious. Potential fine: $18,500 per violation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 76 357 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 357 Td (Half-face respirator or N95 mask when working with volatile solvents or powders. Ref: Sec.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 343 Td (4.1\(b\), 29 CFR 1910.134. Severity: Serious. Potential fine: $16,550.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 76 326 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 326 Td (Indirect-vent chemical splash goggles. Ref: Sec. 4.1\(c\), 29 CFR 1910.133. Severity:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 86 312 Td (Serious. Potential fine: $16,550.) Tj ET
